        "name": "Progress Sync",
        "description": "Adds a \"Sync progress\" button to movie, series, season and episode pages, watch status on movie and episode pages, a watch history dashboard, separate playback-limits and progress-sync tabs, and per-user concurrent playback limits. Copy another user's resume position and watched state to your account once, or link a movie or series to keep it in sync (follow or two-way). Requires the File Transformation plugin.\n",
